WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.082
Vinnie and Edward ran down the streets of London.

2
00:00:04.083 --> 00:00:08.605
When they got to the Globe Theater, it was full of people.

3
00:00:08.606 --> 00:00:11.550
Edward paid and they went inside.

4
